<h2>The Trade That's Frozen in Place</h2>
<p>On June 30, 2026, the Clippers and Raptors agreed to a trade sending Leonard back to Toronto — the franchise he led to its only championship in 2019 — in exchange for a package built around Brandon Ingram and future draft capital.</p>
